row         Filter: (NOT (ANY ((two = (hashed SubPlan any_1).col1) AND (four = (hashed SubPlan any_1).col2))))
row         SubPlan any_1
row           ->  Gather
row                 Workers Planned: 2
row                 ->  Parallel Seq Scan on sb
row                       Filter: (thousand > 100)
